title: "AI adoption in urban planning governance: systematic review analysis pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible pipeline for a systematic review of AI adoption in urban planning
  governance: corpus assembly from database exports, bibliometric and trend analysis,
  offline geographic mapping with full global country coverage, VOSviewer keyword
  network analysis, and the practical integration matrix.
